  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 9d7ea898f0605b46b3aa06c5dd60dfb1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::HollowCurrent.Interactable
  Kind: 1
  Label: 'Ledger: the painter'
  Body: 'BLOOD LEDGER / THE PAINTER


    He sits for his portrait each night and
    each night the eyes are wrong.


    I kept the moonstone behind the one painting
    that is also a door. He walks past it as if it were a wall.'
